# Cuearr — GitHub account (personal only)

This repo is **personal**: owner `marcatos`, remote `git@github.com-personal:marcatos/cuearr.git`.

## Mandatory

- Before any `gh` call (issues, releases, PRs, API): `gh auth switch --user marcatos` and verify `gh api user --jq .login` prints `marcatos`.
- Never use the work account `yamasimo` / `yamabeast` against this repo.
- Git push/pull: keep SSH host `github.com-personal` (do not rewrite to work `github.com`).
- Tracker: **GitHub Issues** on `marcatos/cuearr` only (not Plane, not work Linear/Jira).

## Why

A previous session left `gh` active as `yamasimo`, which triggered failed CloseIssue calls and notifications on the work account.
